<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Boehm et al. (2010) & Gros et al. (2010) vertebrate limb bud oriented cell division & Wnt5a/FGF8 pushing vs proliferation-gradient hypothesis — Morphometric validation: 95/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L998-1090) computes 8 reference-anchored morphometric measurements: 5-regime 6h PD elongation Pearson r = 0.9970 (RMSE = 1.232%), 5-regime E11.5 aspect-ratio Pearson r = 0.9920 (RMSE = 0.0801), Model II WT 6h PD elongation = 43.3706% (ref 42.16%), Model I negative control = 10.1843% (ref 10.10%), 5-decade Reynolds sensitivity span = 8.6005 percentage points (ref 8.4, r = 0.9995), Specimen Panel F posterior St1/St0 ratio = 1.3587 (derived_from: specimen), Specimen Panel D/E 3D OPT iso-surface AR gain = 1.1732 (derived_from: specimen), and Hooke-Jeeves inverse-opt to empirical distal source ratio = 11.7357 (ref 11.7358)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-5-regime-6h-pd-elongation-hierarchy-pearson-r-vs-empirical>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-5-regime-e11-5-aspect-ratio-l-pd-w-ap-pearson-r-vs-empirical>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-hooke-jeeves-inverse-opt-to-empirical-distal-source-ratio-s-opt-1-s-emp-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-model-i-isotropic-proliferation-6h-pd-elongation-at-re-10-2-negative-control>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-model-ii-wild-type-6h-pd-elongation-vs-opt-st0-st1-benchmark>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-reynolds-number-5-decade-sensitivity-span-re-in-10-6-10-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-specimen-panel-d-vs-panel-e-3d-opt-iso-surface-aspect-ratio-gain>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-specimen-panel-f-posterior-dv-pd-st1-st0-elongation-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Boehm et al. (2010) & Gros et al. (2010) vertebrate limb bud oriented cell division & Wnt5a/FGF8 pushing vs proliferation-gradient hypothesis — MorphoEval overall 94.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py` (overall weighted score: 93.8/100, up from 57.3/100 in v1). The remediated script solves the 2D/3D continuum artificial-compressibility pressure-Poisson & Stokes velocity field (`nabla . v = s(x)`, `-nabla p + (1/Re)*nabla^2 v + nabla . sigma_active = 0`) coupled to Wnt5a/JNK oriented cell division active stress and AER-FGF8/MAPK velocity gradients; reproduces the 5-regime PD elongation hierarchy (Pearson r = 0.9970, RMSE = 1.232%) and E11.5 aspect-ratio hierarchy (Pearson r = 0.9920, RMSE = 0.0801); confirms 5-decade Reynolds-number insensitivity (Re in [10^-6, 10^-1], r = 0.9995, span = 8.60 percentage points); demonstrates the 11.74x Hooke-Jeeves inverse-optimization proliferation gap; and segments 5 sub-panels of the SHA-256-locked OPT specimen image `mouse_limb_bud_specimen.jpg`. Overall 94.0/100 (faithfulness 93.9, reproducibility 94.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 93, Parameter expressivity 94, Morphometric validation 95, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 94, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/limb_bud_elongation_pushing_comparison.png: rendered output of 2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 991910 B, 3300×1380 px, artifact_sha256 e809b1fc6f9248c8c9eb080564b3429e238a87fbb5a336ba5d352fa9851d9379 (sha256 e809b1fc6f9248c8c9eb080564b3429e238a87fbb5a336ba5d352fa9851d9379), spec_fingerprint 4c3f0cfc301e2c955c4f4f6c7d2e02e3996ca3b4cd571d212368d55baab36b29. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 4c3f0cfc301e2c955c4f4f6c7d2e02e3996ca3b4cd571d212368d55baab36b29; artifact_sha256: e809b1fc6f9248c8c9eb080564b3429e238a87fbb5a336ba5d352fa9851d9379. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Extend the 2D mid-plane pressure-Poisson solver to an unstructured 3D tetrahedral finite-element mesh imported directly from Optical Projection Tomography iso-surfaces." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

